 "入り目": "صَرْف, مَصْرُوف (A spending or consuming, often a disbursement of funds.)  [expenses]",
 "入り相": "غُرُوب, مَغْرِب (The moment each evening when the sun disappears below the western horizon.) / غُرُوب اَلشَّمْس (The changes in color of the sky before and after sunset.) / خَاتِمَة, قَيَامَة (The final period of the life of a person or thing.)  [sunset] / [evening bell ; vespers bell]",
 "入り込む": "اِخْتَرَقَ (To enter into; to make way into the interior of; to pierce.)  [to penetrate]\nمثال: その猟師は森の中深く入り込み、二度と帰らなかった。\n→ The hunter went deep into the forest, never to return. / [to become complicated]",
 "入る": "أَدْخَلَ (To cause to go (into), or to be received (into); to put in; to insert; to cause ) / أَدْخَلَ (To type (something) into a computer; to input.) / دَخَلَ (To go into or upon, as lands, and take actual possession of them.)  [to enter]\nmainly used in fixed expressions and literary language / وَضَع (To put (something) down, to rest.) / غَرَبَ (Of a heavenly body, to disappear below the horizon of a planet, etc, as the latt) / مَجْمُوعَة, طَقْم (A matching collection of similar things. (Note the similar meaning in Etymology ) / مَجْمُوعَة (Set theory.)  [to set (of the sun or moon)] / أَصَابَ (To gain (a desired result or other objective) through effort; to accomplish, to )  [to attain (nirvana, enlightenment, etc.)] / [to do fully ; to do intently]\nafter -masu stem of verb",
 "入れ": "حَاوِيَة (Someone who contains; something that contains.)  [container]\nمثال: 現金入れの箱にはほとんどお金が残っていないことがわかった。\n→ We found there was scarcely any money left in the cash-box. / أَدْخَلَ (To put in between or into.)  [inserting]",
 "入れなおす": "[to reinsert ; to put in again] / جَدَّدَ (To make (something) new again; to restore to freshness or original condition.) / جَدِد (To repeat.)  [to renew (one's resolve)] / [to pour again (e.g. tea) ; to brew afresh]\nocc. as 淹れ直す / [to reinstall (e.g. software, app)]",
 "入れぼくろ": "[fake beauty mark ; drawn-on beauty spot] / وَشْم (An image made on a body part, usually the skin with ink and a needle.) / وَشَمَ, وَشَّمَ (To apply a tattoo to (someone or something).)  [tattoo]",
 "入れる": "[to put in ; to let in]\nمثال: それは引き出しに入れておきました。\n→ I put it in the drawer. / أَعْتَرَفَ (To concede as true; to acknowledge or assent to, as an allegation which it is im)  [to admit]\nمثال: 留学生も入れるのかしら。\n→ Can foreign students be in the club? / قَبِلَ (To receive, especially with a consent, with favour, or with approval.) / اِعْتَرَفَ (To admit to a place or a group.) / قَبِلَ (To receive or admit to; to agree to; to assent to; to submit to.)  [to accept]\nesp. 容れる / تضمن (To enclose, confine.)  [to include]",
 "入れ交ぜる": "خَلَطَ, مَزَجَ (To stir together.)  [to mix]",
 "入れ代り": "نَوْبَة (A change of workers, now specifically a set group of workers or period of workin)  [shifting]\nمثال: 最近、社員の入れ替わりが激しくないですか。\n→ The turnover at my company is really speeding up lately.",
 "入れ代る": "[to change places (with) ; to be replaced (with, by)] / تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change (seats, shifts, etc.; with someone)]",
 "入れ代わり": "نَوْبَة (A change of workers, now specifically a set group of workers or period of workin)  [shifting]\nمثال: 最近、社員の入れ替わりが激しくないですか。\n→ The turnover at my company is really speeding up lately.",
