 "入れ替え": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [change]\nمثال: もし、システムの完全な入れ替えが必要ということになれば、彼らは古いシステムで満足することと思う。\n→ If it's going to require a total restructuring, I'm sure they will be satisfied with the old system. / حَوَّلَ (To divert to a less important place, position, or state.)  [shunting (rail)]",
