 "入れ替わる": "[to change places (with) ; to be replaced (with, by)] / تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change (seats, shifts, etc.; with someone)]",
