 "入会": "وَصَلَ (To connect or combine into one; to put together.) / اِتَّصَلَ (To come together; to meet.) / اِلْتَحَقَ بِـ, اِنْضَمَّ إِلَى (To become a member of.)  [joining]\nمثال: 私はそのクラブへの入会を許された。\n→ I gained admission to the club.",
