 "入口": "دُخُول (The action of entering, or going in.) / مَدْخَل (The place of entering, as a gate or doorway.)  [entrance]\nمثال: １台の車が入り口に止まった。\n→ A car stopped at the entrance.",
 "入団": "وَصَلَ (To connect or combine into one; to put together.) / اِتَّصَلَ (To come together; to meet.) / اِلْتَحَقَ بِـ, اِنْضَمَّ إِلَى (To become a member of.)  [joining (a group, team, etc.)]",
