 "入域": "أَدْخَلَ (To cause to go (into), or to be received (into); to put in; to insert; to cause ) / أَدْخَلَ (To type (something) into a computer; to input.) / دَخَلَ (To go into or upon, as lands, and take actual possession of them.)  [entering (a district, zone, etc.)]",
 "入場": "دُخُول (The action of entering, or going in.) / مَدْخَل (The place of entering, as a gate or doorway.)  [entrance]\nمثال: この切符で２名入場できます。\n→ This ticket admits two persons.",
