 "其": "لِكَيْ, أَنْ (Introducing a subordinate clause that expresses an aim, purpose, or goal (“final) / ذٰلِكَ, ذَاكَ (The (thing, person, idea, etc) indicated or understood from context, especially ) / ذَاكَ (that thing) / ذٰلِكَ (that thing) / تِلْكَ (that thing) / اَلَّذِي (which) / اَلَّتِي (which) / اَلَّذِينَ (which)  [that] / مَن, اَلْمَرْء (Anyone, one; an unspecified individual or group of individuals (as subject or ob) / ـكُم, ـكُنَّ (A dummy pronoun used in certain constructions, usually with verbs of receiving ()  [you] / نَفْس (A person's self: general form of himself, herself, themselves or yourself.)  [oneself]",
 "其々": "[come on ; hurry up] / بِالضَّبْط, تَمَامًا (Without approximation; precisely.) / بِالْضَبْط (Signifies agreement or recognition.)  [exactly]",
 "其のため": "وَعَلَيْهِ, وَمِنْ ثَمَّ (As a result; therefore, for this reason.)  [hence]\nمثال: そのため、派遣労働者は劣悪な労働条件の下で働いている。\n→ For that reason, temporary workers are working under inferior conditions.",
 "其のまま": "كَمَا هُوَ, كَمَا هِيَ (as it is; in its present unchangeable state or condition, especially as a contra)  [as is]\nمثال: ドアをそのままにしておいてはいけません。\n→ The door must not be left open. / [just like ; extremely similar] / فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]",
 "其の儘": "كَمَا هُوَ, كَمَا هِيَ (as it is; in its present unchangeable state or condition, especially as a contra)  [as is]\nمثال: ドアをそのままにしておいてはいけません。\n→ The door must not be left open. / [just like ; extremely similar] / فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]",
