 "其の為": "وَعَلَيْهِ, وَمِنْ ثَمَّ (As a result; therefore, for this reason.)  [hence]\nمثال: そのため、派遣労働者は劣悪な労働条件の下で働いている。\n→ For that reason, temporary workers are working under inferior conditions.",
 "其の物": "نَفْسُهُ, نَفْسُهَا (it; used to intensify the subject, especially to emphasize that it is the only p)  [itself]\nمثال: 彼は、彼らに親切そのものだった。\n→ He was kindness itself to them.",
