 "具": "أَدَاة (Any physical device meant to ease or do a task.)  [tool] / مُقَوِّم (One of the substances present in a mixture, especially food.)  [ingredients (added to soup, rice, etc.)]\nمثال: ぎょうざの具のあまりは？餃子を家で作りましたが、皮が少なかったせいか、具が少し余ってしまいました。\n→ Gyoza stuffing? I made some gyoza at home but, possibly because I didn't have enough dough, I had some of the filling left over. / [counter for sets of armor, utensils, furniture, etc.]",
