 "具合が悪い": "[unwell ; in a bad state] / مُعَطَّل (Not functioning properly; not in working order.)  [out of order] / [inconvenient ; troublesome] / غَيْر مُرِيح (Not comfortable; causing discomfort.)  [uncomfortable]",
