 "出なおす": "[to make a fresh start ; to turn over a new leaf]\nمثال: 心機一転して出直すのが一番だね。\n→ You'll have to turn over a new leaf. / عَفْواً! (could you repeat that) / مَاذَا قُلْتَ؟ (could you repeat that) / مَاذَا قُلْتِ؟ (could you repeat that) / هَلَّا أَعَدْتَ مَا قُلْتَ؟ (could you repeat that) / هَلَّا أَعَدْتِ مَا قُلْتِ؟ (could you repeat that)  [to come again]",
