 "出世": "تَرْقِيَة, تَرْفِيع (An advancement in rank or position.) / تَرْوِيج (Dissemination of information in order to increase its popularity.) / تَرْقِيَة (Transformation of a pawn into a piece (by reaching the opponent's back rank).)  [promotion]\nمثال: もちろん私は自らの努力で出世するべきだという考えに賛成です。\n→ Obviously I agree that you should advance in life through your own efforts.",
