 "出会い": "اِجْتِمَاع, مَجْلِس (A gathering of persons for a purpose; an assembly.) / مُلَاقَاة, مُقَابَلَة (An encounter between people, even accidental.) / مُلَاقَاة, لِقَاء (An administrative unit in the Religious Society of Friends (Quakers).)  [meeting]\nمثال: 私たちの出会いはまったくの偶然でした。\n→ Our meeting was quite accidental. / [meeting for the first time ; coming across] / [confluence]\nesp. 出合い, 出合",
