 "出典": "مَصْدَر, مَصَادِر (The person, place, or thing from which something (information, goods, etc.) come) / عَيْن (Spring; fountainhead; wellhead; any collection of water on or under the surface ) / مَصْدَر (A reporter's informant.)  [source (e.g. quotation)]\nمثال: 確かに、Ｍａｎｋｉｎｄ　Ｑｕａｒｔｅｒｌｙ誌は出典として頼るにはもっとも奇妙なものである。\n→ Surely the most curious of sources consulted is Mankind Quarterly.",
