 "出頭命令": "اِسْتِدْعَاء (A call to do something, especially to come.) / اِسْتِدْعَاء (A notice summoning someone to appear in court, as a defendant, juror or witness.)  [summons]",
 "出願": "تَطْبِيق (The act of physically applying or laying on.) / تَطْبِيق (A computer program or the set of software that the end user perceives as a singl) / كِتَاب, اِسْتِمَارَة (A verbal or written request for assistance or employment or admission to a schoo)  [application]\nمثال: １つ１つの出願を１件ずつ考慮しなければならないだろう。\n→ We will have to consider each application on a case-by-case basis.",
