 "刀": "سَيْف, حُسَام (A long bladed weapon with a grip and typically a pommel and crossguard (together) / سَيَّافٌ (One of the end bars by which the lay of a hand loom is suspended.)  [sword (esp. Japanese single-edged)]\nمثال: 「刀の投擲の練習？」「すっぽ抜けただけです」\n→ \"Practising sword throwing?\" \"It just slipped out of my hands.\" / مِشْرَط (A small straight knife with a very sharp blade used for surgery, dissection and )  [scalpel] / إِزْمِيل (A cutting tool used to remove parts of stone, wood or metal by pushing or poundi)  [chisel] / [knife money (knife-shaped commodity money used in ancient China)]",
 "刀剣": "سَيْف, حُسَام (A long bladed weapon with a grip and typically a pommel and crossguard (together) / سَيَّافٌ (One of the end bars by which the lay of a hand loom is suspended.)  [sword]",
