 "分け": "تَقْسِيم (The act or process of dividing anything.) / قِسْمَة (The process of dividing a number by another.) / قِسْمَةٌ (A calculation that involves this process.) / فِرْقَة (A formation, usually made up of two or three brigades.) / فُرْقَة (A disagreement; a difference of viewpoint between two sides of an argument.)  [division]\nمثال: 彼らは財産分けのことでもめている。\n→ They are arguing about their share of the property. / إِقْتِسَام, مُقَاسَمَة (Something shared; a point in common.)  [sharing] / دَلَجَ, غَرَفَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / رَسَمَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / قُرْعَة (The act of drawing:)  [draw]",
