 "創る": "فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make]\n造る usu. for large-scale building, manufacturing, etc.; 創る usu. for creating\nمثال: どこへ行っても、彼は必ず友達を作る。\n→ Wherever he may go, he is sure to make friends. / جَهَّزَ, حَضَّرَ (To make ready for a specific future purpose; to set up; to assemble or equip; to) / اِسْتَعَدَّ, تَأَهَّبَ (To make oneself ready; to get ready, make preparation.)  [to prepare (food)]\nمثال: たまごを割らずにオムレツは作れない。\n→ You can't make an omelet without breaking eggs. / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise]\nمثال: あなたの菜園で作れる穀物や野菜を食べて生活する方がずっと安上がりだ。\n→ It's much cheaper to live on grains and vegetables you can grow in your garden. / حَتَّى, إِلَى أَنّ (Until; to, up to; as late as (a given time).) / حَتَّى (Until, until the time that.) / حَرَثَ (To work or cultivate or plough (soil); to prepare for growing vegetation and cro)  [to till]",
