 "創業": "تَأْسِيس (The act or process of establishing; a ratifying or ordaining; settlement; confir) / تَأْسِيس (The state of being established, founded, etc.; fixed state.) / مُؤَسَّسَة (That which is established; as a form of government, a permanent organization, bu)  [establishment (of a business)]",
