 "創業者": "مُؤَسِّس, مُؤَسِّسَة (One who founds or establishes (a company, project, organisation, state, etc.).)  [founder (of a company)]",
 "創生": "خِلْقَة, خَلْق (Something created such as an invention or artwork.) / اِبْتِكَار, خَلْق (The act of creating something.) / خَلْق (All which exists.)  [creation]",
 "創痍": "جُرْح, جِرَاحَة (An injury, such as a cut, stab, or tear, to a (usually external) part of the bod) / جَرَحَ (To hurt or injure (someone) by cutting, piercing, or tearing the skin.)  [wound (from an edged weapon)] / عُطْل, ضَرَر (Injury or harm; the condition or measure of something not being intact.)  [damage]",
