 "創立": "تَأْسِيس (The act or process of establishing; a ratifying or ordaining; settlement; confir) / تَأْسِيس (The state of being established, founded, etc.; fixed state.) / مُؤَسَّسَة (That which is established; as a form of government, a permanent organization, bu)  [establishment]\nمثال: 私たちの学校は創立して５０年だ。\n→ Our school is fifty years old.",
 "創立者": "مُؤَسِّس, مُؤَسِّسَة (One who founds or establishes (a company, project, organisation, state, etc.).)  [founder]\nمثال: そのホールは創立者を記念して立てられたものだ。\n→ The hall was built in memory of the founder.",
