 "力の能率": "عَزْم (The turning effect of a force applied to a rotational system at a distance from )  [moment of force]",
 "力み": "سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [straining] / وَضْعِيَّة (The position of someone or something relative to another; position; situation.)  [posturing (in speech or attitude)] / عِنَاد (The state, or an act, of stubbornness or doggedness.)  [obstinacy]",
 "力む": "سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [to strain (oneself)] / [to put on a bold front ; to make a show of strength]",
 "力をつける": "[to build up one's strength ; to get stronger] / شَجَّعَ (To spur on, strongly recommend.)  [to encourage (someone)]",
 "力を付ける": "[to build up one's strength ; to get stronger] / شَجَّعَ (To spur on, strongly recommend.)  [to encourage (someone)]",
 "力を入れる": "سُلَالَة (Race; lineage, pedigree.)  [to strain]\nمثال: 群衆に押されないよう力を入れて踏ん張った。\n→ I braced myself against the crowd.",
 "力を合わせる": "تَعَاوَنَ (To work or act together, especially for a common purpose or benefit.)  [to cooperate]\nمثال: すべての将兵が力を合わせて反撃した。\n→ All the officers and men joined their efforts against the attack.",
 "力を抜く": "اِسْتَرْخَى (To become loose.)  [to relax]\nمثال: オー、かわいいかわいい私の娘よ。腰をおろして、肩の力を抜いて、目を閉じていなさい。\n→ \"Oh, darling,\" she said, \"sit down, relax, and close your eyes.\"",
 "力付ける": "شَجَّعَ (To spur on, strongly recommend.)  [to encourage (someone)]",
 "力作": "[painstaking piece of work ; work of great effort]\nesp. りきさく\nمثال: 今回発売されたアルバムは、ストーリー仕立てになっていて力作だ。\n→ Her latest album is a tour de force. It even has a storyline. / كَدْح (Labour, work, especially of a grueling nature.) / تَعِبَ, كَدَحَ (To labour; work.)  [toil]\nesp. りょくさく",
 "力価": "سُلْطَة (Power, authority.) / قُوَّة, فَعَّالِيَّة (Concentration; strength)  [potency]",
 "力倆": "قُدْرَة, مَقْدِرَة (The quality or state of being able; capacity to do or of doing something; having) / مَوْهِبَة (A skill or competence in doing; mental power; talent; aptitude.)  [ability]\nمثال: 地位は君の力量しだいだ。\n→ The position is conditional on how well you are able to perform. / [physical strength]",
 "力学": "مِيكَانِيكَا, مِيكَانِيكِيَّة (The branch of physics that deals with the action of forces on material objects w)  [mechanics]\nمثال: 熱力学の背後には、第１巻で学んだ力学の法則にしたがう原子や分子の運動があります。\n→ Behind thermodynamics lie the movements of atoms and molecules following the laws of motion learned in the first volume.",
