 "勢力": "نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [influence]\nمثال: 地球側の圧政に苦しむコロニーの人々の中で、テロによる現状打破を目論む勢力が誕生。\n→ Among the people of the colonies suffering under Earth's tyranny a force emerges intending to overthrow the status quo through terrorism. / نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [influence (of stones)]",
