 "危うい": "خَطِر (Full of danger.)  [dangerous]\nusu. as 危ういところ\nمثال: 危うい所を助かった。\n→ I had a narrow escape. / مخوف (Dangerous, full of peril.)  [perilous (state, balance, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は今入院中で、生きられるかどうかは危うい状態だ。\n→ He is now in the hospital and his life is in the balance.",
 "危うく": "بِٱلْكَاد (By a small margin.)  [barely] / تَقْرِيبًا, عَلَى وَشْك (Very close to, but not quite.)  [almost]\nمثال: 我々はあやうく凍死するところだった。\n→ We were nearly frozen to death.",
 "危ない": "خَطِر (Full of danger.)  [dangerous]\nمثال: 火は非常に危ない。\n→ Fire is very dangerous. / فِي خَطَرٍ (In a dangerous position or place; exposed to risk.)  [in danger]\nمثال: 彼の命が危ない。\n→ His life is in danger. / [uncertain ; unreliable]\nمثال: 危ない空模様だ。\n→ The weather is threatening. / أَغْلَقَ, سَكَّر (To remove or block an opening, gap or passage through.) / قَرِيب (Having little difference or distance in place, position, or abstractly; see also)  [close (call)]\nمثال: 間一髪！危ないところでした。\n→ That was a close call.",
 "危なかしい": "خَطِر (Full of danger.)  [dangerous]\nnon-standard variant of 危なっかしい",
