 "危なく": "تَقْرِيبًا (In close approximation; almost, virtually.)  [nearly]\nمثال: 危なく車にひかれるところだった。\n→ I was nearly run over by a car.",
 "危なげ": "خَطِر (Dangerous; involving risks.)  [risky]",
 "危なげない": "أَمِين, سَالِم (Not in danger; out of harm's reach.) / خَزْنَة حَدِيدِيَّة, خَزْنَة (A box, usually made of metal, in which valuables can be locked for safekeeping.)  [safe]",
 "危なっかしい": "خَطِر (Full of danger.)  [dangerous]",
