 "危局": "أَزْمَة, بُحْرَان (An unstable situation, in political, social, economic or military affairs, espec) / أَزْمَة (A traumatic or stressful change in a person's life.)  [crisis]",
 "危急": "طَوَارِئ, حَالَةْ اَلطَّوَارِئ (A situation which poses an immediate risk and which requires urgent attention.)  [emergency]\nمثال: 彼女は危急の事態に備えた。\n→ She provided for an urgency. / عرضة (exposed to attack) / عُرْضَة لِلْجَرْح (exposed to attack) / هَشّ (exposed to attack) / ضَعِيْف (exposed to attack)  [Vulnerable (conservation status)]",
