 "危惧": "خَوْف, وَهَل (A strong, unpleasant emotion or feeling caused by actual or perceived danger or ) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To feel fear.) / خَافَ عَلَى, خَشِيَ عَلَى (To worry about, to feel concern for, to be afraid for [with for].) / خَافَ, خَشِيَ (To venerate; to feel awe towards.)  [fear]\nمثال: 今いる市民が逃げ出すという事態が危惧されます。\n→ It is feared that those citizens now present will run away.",
