 "卵": "بَيْضَة (An approximately spherical or ellipsoidal body produced by birds, insects, repti)  [eggs]\nمثال: 卵を一ダースづつつめなさい。\n→ Pack eggs in dozens. / بَيْضَة (An approximately spherical or ellipsoidal body produced by birds, insects, repti)  [(hen's) egg]\noft. 玉子 in cooking\nمثال: 卵は硬くゆでてください。\n→ Boil the eggs hard. / مُسْتَقْبَل (The time ahead; those moments yet to be experienced.) / مُسْتَقْبَلِيّ, مُسْتَقْبَل (Having to do with or occurring in the future.)  [future (lawyer, doctor, etc.)]\nas ...の卵\nمثال: 彼は医者の卵だ。\n→ He's a future doctor. / بِدَايَة (The act of doing that which begins anything; commencement of an action, state, o) / بِدَايَة (That which begins or originates something; the source or first cause.) / بِدَايَة (The initial portion of some extended thing.)  [beginning]",
