 "反": "ضِدّ, مُضَادّ (Against, opposed to.)  [anti-]\nمثال: それは反道徳的だ。\n→ It is still immoral. / [antithesis] / [fanqie ; traditional Chinese spelling system in which two characters are used: the first one for the onset,…]",
 "反し": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [return] / [return gift ; return favour] / [barb (on a fishing hook)] / [mixture of soy sauce, sugar and mirin]",
 "反すう動物": "مُجْتَرّ (Chewing cud.) / مُجْتَرّ, مُجْتَرَّات (Any artiodactyl ungulate mammal which chews cud in the suborder Ruminantia, such)  [ruminant]",
 "反する": "نَاقَضَ (To be contrary to (something).)  [to contradict]\nمثال: お金を借りる事は私の主義に反する。\n→ It is against my principles to borrow money. / اِنْتَهَكَ (To break or disregard (a rule or convention).)  [to violate] / عَصَى (To refuse or (intentionally) fail to obey.)  [to disobey (an order, teachings, etc.)]\nalso written as 叛する",
 "反って": "عَلَى الْعَكْس, بِالْعَكْس (Opposite of what had earlier been expected or assumed; to the contrary.)  [on the contrary]\nمثال: 高望みをするとかえって損をする。\n→ You may go farther and fare worse.",
 "反らす": "ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [to bend]",
 "反らせる": "ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [to bend]\nمثال: 仕事から気をそらせてはいけません。\n→ Do not take your mind off work.",
 "反り": "انحناء (The shape of something curved.)  [curvature] / منحنى (A bend, such as in a road.)  [curve (of a sword)]",
 "反り立つ": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (steeply)]\nfrom そそり立つ",
 "反り舌音": "مُرْتَدّ (bent backwards)  [retroflex]",
 "反り返り": "ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [bend]",
 "反る": "منحنى (A bend, such as in a road.)  [to curve] / [to bend backward (body or body part, e.g. fingers)]",
 "反キリスト": "ضِدّ الْمَسِيح, الدَّجَّال (One who works against the teachings of Christ.)  [Antichrist]",
 "反セム": "مُعَادَاة السَّامِيَّة (Prejudice, discrimination, hostility or political or religious opposition direct)  [anti-Semitism]",
 "反セム主義": "مُعَادَاة السَّامِيَّة (Prejudice, discrimination, hostility or political or religious opposition direct)  [anti-Semitism]",
 "反ファシズム": "مُعَادَاة الْفَاشِيَّة (The opposition to fascist ideologies, organizations, governments and people.)  [anti-fascism]",
