 "反主流": "هُدْب (decorative border) / هُدُب (decorative border)  [fringe]",
 "反乱": "انتفاضة (The action of part or all of a national population violently rising up against t)  [insurrection]\nمثال: 軍隊は簡単に反乱を鎮圧した。\n→ The troops easily put down the rebellion.",
 "反乱分子": "مُتَمَرِّد, مُتَمَرِّدَة (A person who resists an established authority, often violently.) / تَمَرَّدَ, يَتَمَرَّدُ (To resist or become defiant toward an authority.)  [rebels]",
 "反乱者": "مُتَمَرِّد, مُتَمَرِّدَة (A person who resists an established authority, often violently.) / تَمَرَّدَ, يَتَمَرَّدُ (To resist or become defiant toward an authority.)  [rebel]",
 "反体制派": "مُنْشَقّ (A person who formally opposes the current political structure, the political gro)  [dissidents]",
 "反作用": "رَدّ فِعْل, تَفَاعُل (An action or statement in response to a stimulus or other event.) / تَفَاعُل (A transformation in which one or more substances is converted into another by co)  [reaction]",
 "反例": "مِثَال مُعَاكِس, مِثَال مُضَادّ (An example that counters a general rule; an exception to a general rule; a speci)  [counterexample]",
 "反則": "مُخَالَفَة (A foul ball, a ball which has been hit outside of the base lines.)  [foul] / اِنْتِهَاك (act or instance of violating)  [violation (of the law, regulations, etc.)]",
 "反則プレー": "مُخَالَفَة (A foul ball, a ball which has been hit outside of the base lines.)  [foul]",
 "反則負け": "إِقْصَاء (The act of disqualifying, or the state of being disqualified)  [disqualification]",
 "反則金": "غَرَامَة (A fee levied as punishment for breaking the law.) / غَرَّمَ (To issue a fine as punishment to (someone).)  [fine]",
 "反力": "رَدّ فِعْل, تَفَاعُل (An action or statement in response to a stimulus or other event.) / تَفَاعُل (A transformation in which one or more substances is converted into another by co)  [reaction]",
 "反動": "رَدّ فِعْل, تَفَاعُل (An action or statement in response to a stimulus or other event.) / تَفَاعُل (A transformation in which one or more substances is converted into another by co)  [reaction]",
 "反動主義者": "رجعي (Extremely conservative; opposing revolution (such as the French Revolution); fav)  [reactionary]\nمثال: 保守主義の人が必ずしも反動主義者とは限らない。\n→ A conservative is not always a reactionary.",
 "反動家": "رجعي (Extremely conservative; opposing revolution (such as the French Revolution); fav)  [reactionary]",
 "反動減": "رَفَضَ (To choose not to do something; refuse, forbear, refrain.)  [decline]",
 "反動的": "رجعي (Extremely conservative; opposing revolution (such as the French Revolution); fav)  [reactionary]",
 "反古にする": "خُرْدَة (Discarded objects (especially metal) that may be dismantled to recover their con) / يتخلى, نبذ (To discard; to get rid of.) / شجار (to fight)  [to scrap]\nمثال: 一族が苦労して積み上げてきたものを、お前は一瞬で反故にするつもりか。\n→ Do you intend to throw away in one instant what our family has painstakingly built up? / [to make null and void ; to renege]",
 "反吐": "تَقَيَّأَ, قَاءَ (To regurgitate or eject the contents of the stomach through the mouth; puke.) / تَقَيُّؤ (The act of vomiting.)  [vomit]",
 "反吐が出る": "[to be nauseating ; to be disgusting] / تَقَيَّأَ, قَاءَ (To regurgitate or eject the contents of the stomach through the mouth; puke.) / تَقَيُّؤ (The act of vomiting.)  [to vomit]",
 "反対": "مقابلة (The apparent relative position of two celestial bodies when one is at an angle o) / مُعَارَضَة, مُقَاوَمَة (A political party or movement opposed to the party or government in power.) / تَنَاقُضْ (The difference of quantity or quality between two propositions having the same s)  [opposition]\nمثال: 私は、その請求書を払う事に反対した。\n→ I objected to paying the bill. / عَكَسَ (To turn something around so that it faces the opposite direction or runs in the )  [reverse]",
 "反対側": "مقابلة (The apparent relative position of two celestial bodies when one is at an angle o) / مُعَارَضَة, مُقَاوَمَة (A political party or movement opposed to the party or government in power.) / تَنَاقُضْ (The difference of quantity or quality between two propositions having the same s)  [opposition]\nمثال: 彼女は３０分で反対側についた。\n→ She was across in thirty minutes.",
 "反対票": "بَل (Or rather, or should I say; moreover (introducing a stronger and more appropriat)  [nay]",
 "反対給付": "واحدة بواحدة (Something which is offered or asked for in exchange for something else.)  [quid pro quo]",
 "反対者": "خَصْم (One who opposes another; one who works or takes a position against someone or so)  [opponent]",
 "反対語": "عَكْس (word which has the opposite meaning) / نَقِيض (word which has the opposite meaning)  [antonym]\nمثال: 例えば、「喜び」の反対語は「悲しみ」です。\n→ For instance, \"delight\" is the opposite of \"sorrow.\"",
 "反対陣営": "مقابلة (The apparent relative position of two celestial bodies when one is at an angle o) / مُعَارَضَة, مُقَاوَمَة (A political party or movement opposed to the party or government in power.) / تَنَاقُضْ (The difference of quantity or quality between two propositions having the same s)  [opposition]",
 "反射": "اِنْعِكَاس, عَكْس (The act of reflecting or the state of being reflected.)  [reflection]\nمثال: 目が部屋の明かりを反射したときに彼女の目は輝いた。\n→ Her eyes shone as they reflected the light of the room. / مُنْعَكَس (An automatic response to a simple stimulus which does not require mental process)  [reflex]",
 "反射代名詞": "ضَمِير اِنْعِكَاسِيّ (In English: a personal pronoun, having a form of \"-self\" as a suffix to show tha)  [reflexive pronoun (in Japanese grammar only)]",
 "反射指示代名詞": "ضَمِير اِنْعِكَاسِيّ (In English: a personal pronoun, having a form of \"-self\" as a suffix to show tha)  [reflexive pronoun]",
 "反射波": "صَدًى (A reflected sound that is heard again by its initial observer.)  [echo]"
